{
  "name": "02 Scrape Web Pages, Summarize and Store",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Overview – Workflow 02\n**Goal:** scrape store web pages, summarize each with the LLM, and store the summaries in Pinecone with metadata `source = website` and `url`.\n\nFlow: read `data/urls.txt` → one item per URL → HTTP GET page → extract text from HTML → LLM summary → embed → Pinecone insert.\n\nCourse: Capstone (web scraping + summarization), Sessions 5–6 (LLM chains), 7–9 & 18 (Pinecone + metadata), 14–15 (second knowledge base).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "2b4cf87a-4bf2-505d-bb6e-1972fcbc8bbc",
      "name": "Overview – Workflow 02",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "6a40a4c4-c607-59ae-b301-70085a3fc12a",
      "name": "Start Scraping",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kritikab01/ShopAssist-AI/main/data/urls.txt",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a5ef2904-e678-5c2e-be08-c003b5fa34ae",
      "name": "Read urls.txt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// urls.txt has one URL per line. Turn it into one n8n item per URL.\nconst text = $input.first().json.data || '';\nreturn text\n  .split('\\n')\n  .map(line => line.trim())\n  .filter(line => line.startsWith('http'))\n  .map(url => ({ json: { url } }));\n"
      },
      "id": "46b052e8-cd21-5da7-be25-b5419d8d1aa1",
      "name": "Split URLs into Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        400,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "90186981-c337-5cbe-8d19-0cf8c2bfc004",
      "name": "Fetch Page HTML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "extractHtmlContent",
        "dataPropertyName": "data",
        "extractionValues": {
          "values": [
            {
              "key": "title",
              "cssSelector": "title"
            },
            {
              "key": "content",
              "cssSelector": "body",
              "skipSelectors": "nav,header,footer,script,style"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "trimValues": true,
          "cleanUpText": false
        }
      },
      "id": "9e2c2d25-d6ab-5570-8384-3cb05fa5d771",
      "name": "Extract Text from HTML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.html",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Summarize this web page of the online clothing store UrbanThread for a customer-support knowledge base. Keep ALL concrete facts: numbers, prices in Rs, dates, coupon codes, time limits and conditions. Use short bullet points, max 200 words. Do not add anything that is not in the page.\n\nPage title: {{ $json.title }}\n\nPage text:\n{{ $json.content }}"
      },
      "id": "0a56aa0a-29fb-5b2f-a3d5-9d179da2ab43",
      "name": "Summarize Page (LLM)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        1000,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-flash-latest",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "8f131f2c-f443-54f4-a959-883839751a24",
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_gemini",
          "name": "Google Gemini account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Split URLs into Items').item.json.url }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "title",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract Text from HTML').item.json.title }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "summary",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6ff07002-20ea-5f33-a127-ddc29be7a6cb",
      "name": "Prepare Document",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "pineconeIndex": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "shopassist",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "172e036a-64dc-580e-8f5d-d4e0a798f4a3",
      "name": "Insert into Pinecone (source=website)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStorePinecone",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1480,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "pineconeApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_pinecone",
          "name": "Pinecone account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-embedding-001"
      },
      "id": "fbe9d159-d76f-5b02-8850-6f49dc3a9b05",
      "name": "Gemini Embeddings",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_gemini",
          "name": "Google Gemini account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "json",
        "jsonMode": "expressionData",
        "jsonData": "=Page: {{ $json.title }}\nURL: {{ $json.url }}\n\n{{ $json.summary }}",
        "textSplittingMode": "custom",
        "options": {
          "metadata": {
            "metadataValues": [
              {
                "name": "source",
                "value": "website"
              },
              {
                "name": "url",
                "value": "={{ $json.url }}"
              },
              {
                "name": "title",
                "value": "={{ $json.title }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "7545705d-b310-5d83-813c-6d1ea4af2cd7",
      "name": "Default Data Loader (summary)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1600,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chunkSize": 1000,
        "chunkOverlap": 200,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "46d9e97e-7489-5d97-9ebd-2d9a15e9a16f",
      "name": "Recursive Text Splitter 1000/200",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textSplitterRecursiveCharacterTextSplitter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step notes\n- **Read urls.txt** downloads the URL list from GitHub (one URL per line).\n- **Fetch Page HTML** runs once per URL (n8n loops over items automatically).\n- **Extract Text from HTML** keeps `<body>` text and skips nav/header/footer.\n- **Summarize Page** = Basic LLM Chain + Gemini Flash (latest) (temperature 0).\n- **Default Data Loader** stores the summary with metadata `source=website`, `url`, `title` so the agent can cite the page.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 320
      },
      "id": "6f8a4716-cb4b-5943-82e7-18877b380559",
      "name": "Step notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1880,
        -40
      ]
    }
  ],
